1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Vibe Wallet — a voice wallet for NEAR testnet. Type or speak. Slide to confirm.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Open the shared demo account. The private key stays on the server, never in the browser.

3
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Type a send, enter the confirm phrase, and slide to confirm. A real testnet transfer is submitted.

4
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:05,000
The receipt includes a testnet explorer link.

5
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:25,000
A send above the 0.3 NEAR limit is blocked. The orb explains why. Nothing is signed.

6
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:40,000
A payment to an account that is not on the allowlist is also blocked.

7
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Add a daily payment rule and a price-trigger rule. Price rules only fetch a dry NEAR Intents quote.

8
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Run the agent, then turn on the kill switch. The agent stops. Testnet only.
